nges you will face? Then go ahead and prove to them that you're the best Captain they've ever had!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808930/extras/8f0c87f3493efb10627a3394c78c1923.poster.avif?t=1751560293\" width=616 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808930/extras/8f0c87f3493efb10627a3394c78c1923.webm?t=1751560293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808930/extras/8f0c87f3493efb10627a3394c78c1923.mp4?t=1751560293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808930/extras/39780ff9f3699f65ed94764d88a0c0bd.webp?t=1751560293\" width=616 height=2 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808930/extras/3f3e6ea3a7ac9a3f5a5f1c464fad47e9.webp?t=1751560293\" width=26 height=23 /></span> <strong>SHOW YOUR DOMINANCE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in exciting and colorful turn-based battles. The city is swarming with bandits who turn girls into sex slaves. Rescue the poor girls, and they will join your squad and show you their gratitude!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808930/extras/2a59664476b2da590d156c21aa1b7c7d.poster.avif?t=1751560293\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808930/extras/2a59664476b2da590d156c21aa1b7c7d.webm?t=1751560293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co